n{aligned}20 \\\\ -4+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}].$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce7c440583574e8cdd8fe5a25fea233315a6bf1cc81722a696d3f04e80f9a1fc" "basis" 1662 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-82034" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Since $\\overset{―}{kv}=\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\overset{―}{v},$ we get the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{kv} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\overset{―}{v} \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}20 \\\\ -4+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\overset{―}{[\\begin{aligned}-4+8\\text{i} \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]} \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}20 \\\\ -4+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,[\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{-4+8\\text{i}} \\\\ \\overset{―}{4}\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}20 \\\\ -4+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,[\\begin{aligned}-4-8\\text{i} \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}20 \\\\ -4+8\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}(-4-8\\text{i})\\overset{―}{k} \\\\ 4\\overset{―}{k}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}(-4-8\\text{i})\\overset{―}{k}=20 \\\\ 4\\overset{―}{k}=-4+8\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation, we get \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{k}=-1+2\\text{i}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the first equation, we obtain the true statement\n\n$$\n(-4-8\\text{i})(-1+2\\text{i})=20.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k=\\overset{―}{-1+2\\text{i}}=-1-2\\text{i}.$\n\nFinally, $\\text{Re}(k)=-1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041865/state.json" "file_sha256" "ce7c440583574e8cdd8fe5a25fea233315a6bf1cc81722a696d3f04e80f9a1fc" "basis" 1662 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Co